("v280", "key", "beforeText")
("v281", "type", "String")
("v281", "scalar", "The film is a separate pipeline beside the site. A choreography file sets every scene, plate, light, spark and chime to the tenth of a second; one Python script turns it into picture and sound with ffmpeg and headless Chrome.")
("v280", "value", "v281")
("v275", "entry", "v282")
("v282", "type", "Entry")
("v282", "key", "html")
("v283", "type", "String")
("v283", "scalar", "The original film was made with a separate rendering pipeline. A choreography file set the scenes, lights, sparks and chimes; Python, ffmpeg and headless Chrome produced the picture and sound. This edition retains the rendered files and their manifest.")
("v282", "value", "v283")
