("v292", "type", "String")
("v292", "scalar", "Every file below carries the hash of its bytes, and the whole set carries the hash of the sources that produced it. The site’s tests recompute both: change a single frame’s recipe without re-rendering, and the build refuses to call the film current.")
("v291", "value", "v292")
