("v560", "type", "String")
("v560", "scalar", "Sourcery · Temple Law you can execute.History no one can quietly rewrite. Temple is the ground Sourcery stands on — a kernel where every change is proposed, judged against declared law, and witnessed, whether it is accepted or refused. A speculative film, with a working gate you can try to break. Or watch the 41-second film.")
