("v583", "key", "beforeText")
("v584", "type", "String")
("v584", "scalar", "Where it stands: Sourcery and Claimipedia run on Temple2 today. Temple3 is where the foundation is being recut, rules first. It’s a working laboratory whose results are cross-checked by three implementations (JavaScript, Python and Rust). It isn’t audited or in production, and the Ark is deliberately not yet sealed.")
("v583", "value", "v584")
("v578", "entry", "v585")
("v585", "type", "Entry")
("v585", "key", "html")
("v586", "type", "String")
("v586", "scalar", "Where it stands: this edition runs the story’s bounded examples through process algebra. The wider Sourcery engineering programme is a staged migration of platform and application meaning into algebra-owned sources. The examples do not establish production readiness, an independent security audit or completion of that migration.")
("v585", "value", "v586")
